<title>USA: Washington Health Care yields 5.60 pct in 2010.</title>
<headline>Washington Health Care yields 5.60 pct in 2010.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $15.420 million of Washington Health Care Facilities Authority, revenue refunding bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2010.</p>
